IT:
{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}Ah!{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} Quasi dimenticavo! {{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}Ehi, {{TAG:0000:0003:0400}}Bartolo{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
Puoi prepararmi due caffè
