ES:
{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}¡Estás en lo cierto, sí, sí!{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
Quiero invitar a la pareja
de Reciclaje Bártulos.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}He oído que {{TAG:0000:0003:0400}}Al {{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}trabaja hasta
las tantas de la noche reparando
muebles en su taller.
{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}Esto me hace pensar{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}¡Qué bien se llevan siempre esos{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
dos, y qué buena pareja hacen!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}Viéndolos, uno se plantea{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
que casarse no está tan
mal después de todo.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}Aunque no es que yo esté
pensando en hacerlo, no, no{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}.

EN:
{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Yes, yes!{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
I plan on taking them over to the
owl siblings in the museum!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Taking them coffee in the afternoon
would probably help those two stay
awake better, but{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}.
{{TAG:0003:0002:}}on the other hand,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} there are
probably fewer visitors around at
that time.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
I suppose it's probably easier for
them to take a little break, hm?{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

IT:
{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Sì, sì!{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
Voglio portarli ai due fratelli gufi
che lavorano al museo!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Magari se portassi loro del caffè
durante il pomeriggio, potrei
aiutarli a farli restare svegli{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}.
{{TAG:0003:0002:}}D'altra parte,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} è probabilmente
il momento della giornata
con meno visitatori.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Mmmh, forse è meglio se
schiacciano un pisolino! Sì, sì!{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

